00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.490
Quit dragging me along!

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:41.570
My dear maiden!
Quit dragging me along!

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:41.830
My dear maiden!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:42.190
Come on, Darling!
My dear maiden!

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:43.070
Come on, Darling!

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:43.730
Wait, Ryuunosuke-kun!
Come on, Darling!

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:44.480
Wait, Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.620
Eh? Aren't you going?

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.710
