I'm in front of so many people...!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.830
I'm so embarrassed... but I <i>have</i>  already made it this far...

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.060
...because I up my mind to do the best I can.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.630
Okay!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.250
Aaah! The boingy breasts of a real adult!

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.550
