No!! Stay away from me!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:20.760
She's a high school 2nd-year,
so why is she making memories with <i>them?</i>

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:24.730
Ministry of Safety, control room here.
Report your current situation.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:28.850
10:06 - We're currently above the waters off the coast of Infinite Passions Island. Distance: 3,000.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.950
