00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.580
It's a super-mega-big announcement!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.890
New Rizelmine series: confirmed!

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.710
All right! We'll get all hafu-hafu-hafuun,
